OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Fcontinue to spread south and east
OL,7,Fovernight, wintry over high ground.
OL,8,FThe south seeing the best of any drier
OL,9,Fand clearer spells. Strong winds
OL,10,Feasing and turning westerly.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA mostly cloudy day with some
OL,13,Fbright intervals. Showers spreading
OL,14,Feast, these wintry over high ground at
OL,15,Ffirst. Best of any drier spells in the
OL,16,Feast. Wind strengthening later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
