OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fover the weekend with showers or
OL,7,Fperhaps longer spells of rain
OL,8,Fspreading north and east. Perhaps
OL,9,Fturning drier on Monday with some
OL,10,Fbrighter spells. Strong winds at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
